          }
        }
      }
    },
    "enUS": {
      "description": "<As you tear away the single page from the Twilight Tome, a foreboding voice floods your mind, uninvited.>\r\n\r\nThey have failed.\r\n\r\nYou will be forgotten.\r\n\r\nThey will lose the eye they gained.",
      "dialogue": {
        "a9df4db2ce4b0162556d": "You look troubled. I am listening."
      },
      "summary": "Obtain a Peerless Eye from a Twilight Disciple or Thug at the Master's Glaive in Darkshore and find someone in Auberdine who is willing to take it.",
      "title": "It's All Fun and Games Until...",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "description": {
            "origin": "original",
            "source": "blizzard",
            "sourceLocale": "enUS"
          },
